ession_25","session_index":25,"source_sha256":"9a793e99551bdcc9a3be12967c5d450c344b2ee43f92ccce0e23deb995f7d448","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":13}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- By 2023-05-01, had finally opened his own car maintenance shop — called it a dream come true; \"so satisfying to have a spot to work on cars\"; it was a lot of hard work, but it was worth it [S4T1][S4T3].\n- Shared a photo of the shop (a car dealership with cars parked in front) [S4T1].\n- Opening the shop was his dream and is a step toward his other dream of working on classic cars [S4T3][S4T5].\n- Calvin congratulated him, said his hard work and dedication paid off, praised his \"guts and ambition\", and told him to keep it up [S4T2][S4T4].\n- Called opening the shop a \"labor of love\" — challenging, but \"so worth it\"; feeling the hard work pay off is \"like bringing something back to life\" (echoing his car-restoration sentiment), and he finds it incredible that his skills and hard work made it happen [S4T9][S4T11][S4T13].\n- Says the \"perfect blend of dedication and passion\" keeps him motivated and makes it all worthwhile; Calvin encouraged him to \"keep going for it!\" [S4T14][S4T15][S4T16].\n- Shared a second photo of the shop (a group of people standing in front of a car) and invited Calvin to come by sometime [S4T17].\n- Works on all kinds of cars at the shop — from regular maintenance to full restorations of classic cars — which \"keeps [him] busy and happy\" [S4T18][S4T19].\n- Working on cars is what he's passionate about: doing it every day is \"so rewarding\", \"seeing the transformation is awesome\", and he finds it satisfying to help people keep their cars in good condition [S4T21].\n- Appreciates Calvin's encouragement: \"It means a lot that my work is valued and that it brings joy to others\" [S4T23].\n- On 2023-05-03, announced he is teaming up with a local garage — Calvin called it \"this new venture\"; the exchange included photos of a car being worked on in a garage (Dave's) and of a green car in a garage with a sign in the background (on Calvin's turn) [S5T1][S5T2].\n- \"Loving this job\" — works with awesome mechanics and shares his knowledge about cars; shared a photo of a man working on a car engine in a garage and called the current project cool but a bit challenging [S5T3].\n- For now, focused on continuing to work on the current project and assisting customers [S5T5].\n- On 2023-05-16, told Calvin the shop had opened the previous week (~2023-05-08/14) and that he had invited friends over to celebrate — \"it's been amazing\"; he's \"super stoked to share [his] passion and help out with folks' rides\" and it has \"been incredible so far\" [S6T8]. Note this conflicts with the 2023-05-01 statement that the shop had already opened (see above); the later date is recorded as stated.\n- On 2023-05-16, Calvin congratulated him on opening his own car shop (\"Way to go, Dave!\" — his excitement is contagious, \"keep up the great work\"); Dave thanked him, called it \"quite a journey so far,\" and said he's excited to see what the future holds [S6T9][S6T10].\n- As of 2023-05-31, had recently fixed a neighbor's car engine himself — the neighbor \"had been having some trouble with the engine\", which is now done; shared a photo of himself working on the car engine in a garage. (Calvin recognized the car as the one Dave had been fixing the engine of \"for a friend.\") [S7T2][S7T3].\n- On 2023-10-15, told Calvin it's been \"a crazy rollercoaster week\": a competing car maintenance shop snagged a deal that Dave's shop had been trying to secure for months; he felt \"kinda bummed out\" and questioned whether his hard work is a waste — \"I put in so much effort at work, but it feels like nothing. Am I wasting my time?\"; Calvin encouraged him — \"don't give up, keep pushing and believe in yourself. The payoff will be worth it.\" — and Dave said he's \"gotta have faith and patience\" and is \"sure it's only a matter of time till things work out\" [S23T1][S23T2][S23T3].\n- On 2023-10-23, shared a photo of his garage (a garage with a bunch of tools hanging on the wall — \"a little dirty, but everything is in its place\") while telling Calvin that working on a car is his own outlet (details in the 2023-10-23 entry of ## Relationships and in ## Hobbies and sense of purpose) [S25T13].","text_sha256":"cbdd4b99ec030513938c3c8dcdd433f5966b0d82afc7b86a54b7fba7dcc71c5b","timestamp":null}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":6354,"filesystem_tool_calls":8,"model_calls":17,"orchestration_calls":11,"prompt_tokens":871548,"provider_request_attempts":17,"provider_rounds":17,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":877902},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"56a7ee328b702acf677218605c2d649afe0089eda09165e5aadb286969116965","filesystem_tools_sha256":"6d9d68f047917d20adb9133168d5726233c9719dbefd54627e08827832d963c6","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3506af86ae75acd7ce07f88bae7a25e1bfec56a5b1c9f44abd3d71a2e6f4eb2d","paper_prompt_id":"filesystem-appendix-a3-prompt-5-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"de03315ff999a8bcea7e08a10866f3a6dc74badf690d23a036e35c74ff81335c"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"Does Dave's shop employ a lot of people?","question_id":"conv-50-q008","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run_position":12,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"cce5dd1cc342a87c409268032d680d0f7405bf39ff8b3cbd042bdcca21b10533","runtime_contract":{"evidence_budget_limit":16000,"evidence_budget_unit":"characters","round_limit":40,"runtime_sha256":"a217e40af4a8